74f3c336-4a87-4758-a22a-97c7be8e4a2a	bc3de6e7-de25-48ae-af33-1f5ce31a47fc	Rep visited on 2026-10-28 and shop raised three pending issues: monthly scheme benefit not received, display rack payment pending for two months, and cooler not cooling for a week. Shop placed an order for Kurkure, Lay's, Doritos and Cheetos and said festive extra stock depends on getting the scheme properly.	\N	{"summary_en": "Rep visited on 2026-10-28 and shop raised three pending issues: monthly scheme benefit not received, display rack payment pending for two months, and cooler not cooling for a week. Shop placed an order for Kurkure, Lay's, Doritos and Cheetos and said festive extra stock depends on getting the scheme properly.", "next_visit_date": null}
